WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.128 --> 00:00:10.008
Wedding-parent makeup is the most difficult category in all of beauty makeup.

2
00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:21.864
Unlike a bride in her 20s or 30s, parents come with a lot to address — drooping eyelids, deep wrinkles, thinning hair at the crown — making it a genuinely challenging field.

3
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:29.304
But the wedding morning is so hectic that everything has to be finished within a set time.

4
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:38.952
There's barely any time to discuss style on the spot with a specialist you're meeting for the first time, or to make changes if you're unhappy with the result.

5
00:00:39.288 --> 00:00:45.024
To remove that uncertainty ahead of time, a pre-consultation is essential.

6
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:55.032
Meeting the specialist beforehand, you can try out different hairstyles in front of the mirror and settle on the best one that won't age you.

7
00:00:55.368 --> 00:01:07.248
A personal color analysis can also recommend a hanbok color that makes your complexion look a decade younger, preventing the disaster of a wrong color choice washing out your face.

8
00:01:07.584 --> 00:01:17.232
You get to hear the specialist's advice on how to address your specific concerns and ask whatever questions you have about looking young and beautiful.

9
00:01:17.568 --> 00:01:28.584
Above all, the sense of ease that leaves parents saying, "I feel relieved now," after the consultation is the biggest factor in feeling confident on the wedding day.

10
00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:32.448
That's why a pre-consultation is essential.

11
00:01:32.784 --> 00:01:36.504
A well-prepared parent is the most beautiful.
